    AWS NLB         L4, managed          Ultra low latency, TCP/ UCP
    Nginx           L7, self managed     Reverse proxy + LB combo
    HA proxy        L4/ L7 self managed  High performance, fine control
    Envoy           L7, sidecar          Service mesh (istio)
