        Protocol	    Layer	Use Case	                      Example
        HTTP Proxy	  L7	  Web traffic, API routing	      Nginx, HAProxy
        SOCKS5 Proxy	L5	  General TCP traffic, anonymity	Tor, SSH tunnels
